[statement]
A `!` entry of a condition that forbids the package placed does not
trigger its package: `q`, requested, whose condition is `!a=1`, is not
walked when `a` 1 is placed, but where the request reaches it, after `m`.

[repository]
P:q
V:1
D:e
i:!a=1

P:a
V:1

P:e
V:3

P:m
V:1

[request]
a
m
q

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install a 1
install m 1
install e 3
install q 1
